fter birth and was found and raised by Riana. Her magic spells keep failing because she was born to a mage and a human, so her magical power is weak. Deep down, she wishes she could live as an ordinary girl."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c81532"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/90cbe9475b74a37bb12fbda375e34c5430cecff2c21025d4ff4501f8f17d1e46.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/232cfcee3315778c17d742bf8e53b36c29c309f2ffa83c9dcdd8aea36511876b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさり☆","creatorId":"vndb:s1420","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1420","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1420","name":"由宇 翼","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34488","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c81533","characterName":"リアナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c81533"},"originalCharacterName":"リアナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"300"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A wizard who has lived for over 300 years. She kidnaps the protagonist to use as food for her familiar, all for the sake of her apprentice, Miu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She originally lived in the same town as the protagonist, but now lives alone with Miu in a deep forest whose location is unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is self-centered and treats the protagonist as if he were a mere tool."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c81533"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/95a1a29326f3feeb7aa